==Latin==
{{wikipedia|lang=la}}

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*h₂erkʷ-}}
{{etymon|la|inh|itc-pro>*arkuos>bow|id=bow}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*arkuos|t=bow}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*h₂erkʷos||[[bow]], [[arrow]]}}. Cognate to {{cog|ang|earh}}, whence English {{m|en|arrow}}, as well as {{cog|sla-pro|*orkyta|t=willow}} and {{cog|grc|ἄρκευθος|t=juniper}}, owing to juniper and willow twigs being used to make bows due to their flexibility.<ref>{{R:itc:EDL|page=52|head=arcus}}</ref>

